{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759280/extras/Cast_Cards_Cropped.gif?t=1753010102\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Kumitantei\u2122: Old-School Slaughter</strong> is a murder-mystery tribute to retro anime and pop culture of 1980's Japan, underlined with a dark twist of horror and conspiracy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;<strong>The Empire of Japan, 1986...\u00a0</strong>Awoken in a decaying old bunker, sixteen elite <strong>Absolute Students</strong> are trapped in a kill-or-be-killed <strong>Apathy Experiment</strong>. Will they band together to uncover secrets of this anemoic alternate past, or lose their humanity and\u00a0lives in the present?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stylistically inspired by Rumiko Takahashi and classic Japanese adventure games, blended with a wide variety of interwoven game-types from deck-building to platforming to puzzle solving, and all tightly wrapped in a plot influenced by the Danganronpa series, <strong>Kumitantei\u2122</strong> is a horror-infused love letter to decades of ADVs that wears its many inspirations on its sleeve!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759280/extras/5b26f92f744ae5eb1155c533bbbd8401.avif?t=1753010102\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bond during Free Time!\u00a0</strong>Get to know your classmates by listening to them, giving them gifts, and receive unique powerful cards to use during a Card Battle Debate!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Investigate grisly crime scenes!</strong> Use your detective skills to comb through murdered classmates\u2019 crime scenes and take your evidence to trial!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Survive the Clinical Trial!\u00a0</strong>Cut through lies and deception with a War of Words and one-on-one Card Battle Debates to uncover the truth! These\u00a0high stakes, high energy Clinical Trials can only end in bloodshed, whether it's the culprit's or <u>everyone else's!</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build your deck!\u00a0</strong>Create absolute combos using cards you find in the Bunker and through bonding with your classmates to dominate the Clinical Trials!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Earn Prizes with the Kitty Catcher!</strong> Easily bond with your new friends by giving them personalized gifts from the definitely-not-rigged Kitty Catcher!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Please insert coin!\u00a0</strong>Test your retro gaming skills in a variety of faithfully crafted anemoic riffs on true old-school arcade icons!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759280/extras/Skill_Cards_Cropped.gif?t=1753010102\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759280/extras/Trust_Up_Shigure_Cropped.gif?t=1753010102\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2759280?t=1753010102","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759280/abbcf572fa981d3e115ad28c7bab47331d59bd25/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753010102","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759280/6b4355706673180c15edb453160fc37a6d96384c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753010102","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/27